  "description": "Cypress Hill is the debut studio album by American hip hop group Cypress Hill. It was released through Ruffhouse and Columbia Records on August 13, 1991. The recording sessions were held at Image Recording Studios in Los Angeles from August 1990 to May 1991. The album was produced by DJ Muggs. The album was critically and commercially successful and received major airplay on urban and college radio. The album went double platinum, with over 2 million units sold, in the United States.",
